Title: 3DSShinyHunter Ultra Moon Bridge
Summary: Read-only PK7 RAM bridge for 3DSShinyHunter
Description: |
  Read-only UDP bridge used by the 3DSShinyHunter Python hunt engine.
  The plugin exposes only allow-listed Pokemon Ultra Moon PK7 memory records.
Compatibility: Pokemon Ultra Moon
MemorySize: 5MiB
UsePrivateMemory: true
